== an escape and a bell complete as escapes:
$'osc\e]0;title\ax'
== a C1 control completes as hex escapes:
$'csi\xc2\x9by'
== a quote, a backslash, and DEL are escaped together:
$'mix\'q\\b\x7fz'
== an open single quote splices each control run:
'osc'$'\e'']0;title'$'\a''x
== an open double quote splices each control run:
"csi"$'\xc2\x9b'"y
== the completed word names the file:
found
